# The select cases of html5lib's tree-construction suite, verbatim.
#
# Source: https://github.com/html5lib/html5lib-tests/tree/9329e64/tree-construction
# 9329e64 is the last commit before the suite moved to WPT ("Tree construction tests have
# moved to WPT"). The cases are all the ones naming a  in tree-construction/tests17.dat,
# plus the ones that also name a  in tests9.dat, tests10.dat and tests18.dat — the
# second group is what a scope query that does not stop at a select changes.
#
# This is the relaxed <select> parser: the errors are  and
# , not the  names the removed insertion mode used.
#
# Only the  and  blocks are read by the test;  is upstream's
# parse-error log and is not compared, because this library reports errors in its own
# shape. The text below is upstream's and is not to be reflowed or reformatted.

#data
<!doctype html><table><tbody><select><tr>
#errors
(1,30): unexpected-start-tag
(1,42): premature-eof
#document
| <!DOCTYPE html>
| <html>
|   <head>
|   <body>
|     <select>
|     <table>
|       <tbody>
|         <tr>

